+# Runner & Host Hardening Checklist
+
+Minimum host hardening items for builders & runners:
+- OS updates & minimal packages; disable unnecessary services.
+- Kernel tuning for realtime: PREEMPT_RT kernel where required.
+- CPU isolation and cgroups: reserve cores for RT tasks.
+- Network hardening: restrict SSH, proper firewall rules, isolate build network.
+- Install and verify cosign & rekor-cli are present and pinned to approved versions.
+- Centralized logging: send syslog/journald to remote logging endpoint.
+- Monitoring: node exporter, process exporter for RT processes.
+- Vulnerability scanning: run container and host scans on a schedule.
+- Access control: enforce MFA, restrict sudo to infra operators.
+
+Verification
+- ops/infra/hardening/check_runner_hardening.sh should pass.
+- Periodically run automated vulnerability_scan.sh and review alerts.
